    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "...To think the Shieldguards have fallen this low."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "Take my advice. Kill yourselves now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "All Shieldguards, back in formation! Protect the other soldiers!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Remember! Don't give him any openings!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "*Hiss*..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "There is fear abound in the air."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "The Infected next to you isn't ready at all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_080"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "...I..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_080",
            "name2": "avg_npc_058",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Don't be afraid! The more afraid you are, the more likely he will kill you!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "He may attack at any moment! Eyes open! Don't take your eyes off of him for even one second!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "Looks like I'm leaving empty-handed again. These three cities need to be cut off from the information net for being completely useless."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_080"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "Ugh, ugh...! What are you so smug for?! You..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "Surrender to the local garrison, or I will slice all your mouths and noses off and bringing them with me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_080"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "M-Mouths and noses... Isn't that..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "...The Liches... The Facerending Liches! I-I thought that was just a made up fairy tale...?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "You mean... we are looking at them right now?! The Liches that slice faces off of bodies after killing everyone, leaving behind nothing but a bunch of nameless corpses in the forest?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "How long have these guys been around...? I first heard the story... T-They could only be Liches!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_080",
            "name2": "avg_npc_058",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "No, they aren't legends, and they aren't the Demons in the fairy tales! They're murderers and executioners!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_080",
            "name2": "avg_npc_058",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "How are we even supposed to fight Liches?! We are no match for these guys! We're just people, just normal people!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "The Infected... called himself normal."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "*Huff*..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_080"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "...You... You..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "Help... Help me..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_080",
            "name2": "avg_npc_058",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Don't run away!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "All of you, stay right where you are! You'll die if you run!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_080",
            "name2": "avg_npc_058",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "He's not even human! How are we supposed\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_080",
            "name2": "avg_npc_058",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "I'll kill anyone who runs!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_080",
            "name2": "avg_npc_058",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "What?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Like it or not, you're now in the same boat as everyone else. If the defense line falls, everyone will die!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "They are nowhere as terrifying as you think. They're still made of flesh and blood! Not even the Royal Guards can take down the Shieldguards' layers of defense without a tough fight..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "...But if you're scared, you will become their breakthrough. They'll start with you when the killing starts!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "We're both among the strongest forces in Ursus, and yet the Shieldguards choose to oppose us and stand with the Infected. How foolish."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "These are truly unfortunate times."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "He's unsheathing his blade! Shieldguards, shields up!! Hold!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "*Hiss*..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "...He... He's not attacking?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "...Something is burning. I can smell it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_080"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "Ahh... My body's starting to warm up..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "\u2014Could it be... she's here?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "She's here! She's here! Relax, everyone, she's here! Even the Liches are no match for her flames!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "...Don't let your guard down! The Royal Guards aren't..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "??? ",
        "text": "You wanted to bring whose what back with you now?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "*Huff*..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "??? ",
        "text": "You hurt my people. If you turn to violence, then we will return the favor\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "With violence\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "I see you."
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "3, 7, 22, 36. \u3010Code words\u3011, \u3010Code words\u3011."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "...What are the Ursus Royal Guards... doing here?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "*Huff*..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Talulah... You shouldn't have come. You should've waited for the Captain...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "You want to know why we are here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "We are here because we are looking for the duke's daughter. In other words, you. We need to assess the situation."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The sound of the snow falling to the ground is crisp and clear."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "What did you just call me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "The duke's daughter, and bear this in mind. Given your social standing, surely there are more civilized vocabularies you could use to refer to us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_080"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "...Whose daughter did you just call me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "You deny the truth, as you are wont to."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "You think I'm the daughter of a snake?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "Anger... and it stems from your irritation... You want to run away from the truth."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "The 'Emperors' Blade'...? *Spit*! You came all the way here today to mock me? Or are you here to kill me?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Guard?",
        "text": "*Hiss*."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "\u2014Protect Talulah!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "(My brothers! The Royal Guards may be fierce, but there's only one of them! We have Talulah leading the charge, and we'll hold the line! With the rest of you supporting us, we'll definitely...)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "(...My Infected brothers?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_080"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "(The duke's daughter? What is he talking about?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "*Hiss*."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "You didn't tell them who you really are."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "Is this part of your plan?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_080"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected",
        "text": "...Plan...? What plan?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "How dare you mock her?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "You better watch who you are talking to before you try to provoke someone and turn people against her, executioner. My identity has nothing to do with the goal we are working toward here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "You can only turn one against another if there existed trust between them in the first place. I doubt there is any trust between you and the rest of them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "I can only surmise... You believe the trust they have for you will remain unscathed even after they come to know who you really are."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "All that coming from a masked villain that carries out covert massacres at the Ursus Empire's behest? I'm afraid no one here needs to be criticized by your kind."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "Your words are strong... and confident."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "If this is as you expected... Very well, I must reassess the situation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "I bid you goodbye, then. Remember this well. There is one thing we share with the people standing around you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "We have no trust in you. You must take action to earn even the tiniest trickle of trust."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Stop."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "*Hiss*... You have a question?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "You attacked my people. You know we are here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "Am I perhaps misunderstanding you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Who are you trying to rat our secrets out to?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "*Huff*..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "Which secret?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Soldiers, we can't let him give away our location!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "(Talulah, are you confident... you can defeat a Royal Guard?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "(If we don't do this, we'll face even more losses down the line... We'll have the Patrol Unit and even the Ursus army hunting us down day and night!)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "(It takes the Royal Guards time to respond to our actions.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "(Only if we bring the enemy in front of us under control now will we have the choice between retreating or pressing forward later. If we want to be able to pick, we have to act now!)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Besides, while we may need to raise our guards against him, we have no reason to fear him. He represents fear, but fear doesn't stand a chance against our anger for our unjust treatment."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "\u2014She's right. The guerrillas have no reason to fear the empire's murderers."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "How can we still call ourselves the Aegis of the Infected if we just tremble in fear? A lone man is no match for all of us, united! He's just a lone executioner, nothing more!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "You are mistaken about one thing... I am not here alone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "There is one more of us behind you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
