        }
    },
    {
        "text": "A figure wearing a large overcoat stands solemnly on the path Talulah just took."
    },
    {
        "text": "Each and every flake of white snow, falling from the gray sky up above, abruptly turns black as it lands on his coat, before disintegrating and scattering across the ground as ashes."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "image",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 0
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 3
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "There's two of them...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "So what? Just the two of you trying to cut off the dozens of us? Ridiculous!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_077"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperors' Blade",
        "text": "Daughter of Kashchey, allow me to postulate that you've come to the following conclusion: Your peers will not be suspicious of you merely because of your identity."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
